OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry day across all
OL,6,Fparts with variable amounts of cloud
OL,7,Falong with some bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Light south or southwesterly
OL,9,Fwinds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,13,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,14,Fclear periods. Light south or
OL,15,Fsoutheasterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FAnother dry day with variable
OL,18,Famounts of cloud and some bright or
OL,19,Fsunny spells. Light southeasterly
OL,20,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
